Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): reference for the 3D milling operations

One section per Milling 3D kind in the registry (3D Pocket, 3D Finish,
Deburr): what it is for and when to choose it over a neighbour, its key
settings by tab with the seed defaults, what it picks, its common
refusals, and how it is judged on a reduced-fidelity model. Linked from
the operations page; posting and refusals move down one weight, as in
PR #1260, so the operation reference pages sit before them.

Refs #1250

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
